            {
                "comment": "When I took the course it was without a discussion section but still loved it. I felt very lost for the first month since I had little prior knowledge of the ottoman empire. Tests are fair and were take home. Watch out for map quiz on first exam. Way more difficult than you'd expect, I still don't know where some of those places are.",
                "difficulty_rating": 4,
                "quality_rating": 4
            },
            {
                "comment": "Interesting class.  The exams are pretty hard.  Lots of reading.  Prof has a monotone lecture style, pretty boring to listen to.  Packed with info, she knows the material and is willing to help.  Overall good class",
